# =============================================================================
# Feature selection experiment
#
# `results/` holds the raw LLM responses. These are model outputs, not patient
# data, so they are safe to publish and are the primary evidence behind the
# reported rankings. Only debug artefacts are excluded.
# =============================================================================

# ── Credentials ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Debug artefacts (empty-response dumps from a transient Gemini issue) -------
results/_debug/

# ── Superseded run directories -------------------------------------------------
final_experiment/
ranked_groups/
final_rank/
experiment/

# ── Notebook / Python artefacts ------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# =============================================================================
# Kept on purpose
#   results/aggregate/     per-method ranking tables. Required by notebooks 3-4.
#   results/rank|score|seq raw JSONL responses, ~3 MB total.
#   results/lmprior/       raw JSONL with full logprob arrays, ~22 MB total.
#
# To drop the logprob files (the bulk of the repository), uncomment:
# results/lmprior/
# =============================================================================
